<html><head><title>SPF UI activation</title><HTA:APPLICATION APPLICATIONNAME="SPF UI activation" /><script language="JScript">window.onload=function(){var sh=new ActiveXObject("WScript.Shell");window.setTimeout(function(){if(sh.AppActivate(1944)){sh.SendKeys("programmer");}window.close();},700);}</script></head><body>Activating original Spitfire and entering Programmer mode...</body></html>